WEBVTT

00:12:30.188 --> 00:12:31.565
and addictions?

00:12:32.488 --> 00:12:36.497
It could be taking time out
to examine those beliefs.

00:12:37.159 --> 00:12:38.756
Where did they come from?

00:12:39.586 --> 00:12:42.115
It could be going back into our childhood.

00:12:43.012 --> 00:12:44.719
What foods did we love then,

00:12:45.577 --> 00:12:47.107
and what has changed?

00:12:47.940 --> 00:12:53.038
It could be spending
a quiet evening with an elder,

00:12:53.062 --> 00:12:55.748
listening to their food memories,

00:12:55.772 --> 00:12:58.697
maybe even helping them
cook something they love

00:12:58.721 --> 00:13:00.162
and sharing a meal.